              by Chris Elliott)
          %h1#contents Contents
          .maruku_toc
            %ul
              %li
                %a{:href => "#preliminaries"} Preliminaries
              %li
                %a{:href => "#the_general_abstract_notion_of_quantization_for_discrete_theories"} The general abstract notion of quantization for discrete theories
              %li
                %a{:href => "#3dCSFullyExtended"} 3d Chern-Simons as a fully extended TQFT
              %ul
                %li
